    m_Localized: Environment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535390
    m_Localized: Interface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535391
    m_Localized: Brightness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535392
    m_Localized: 'QUALITY: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535393
    m_Localized: Performance reduces visual cost. Quality keeps more detail. Apply
      changes to preview the selected preset.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535394
    m_Localized: 'MODE: FULLSCREEN'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535395
    m_Localized: 'MODE: WINDOWED'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535396
    m_Localized: Choose fullscreen or a resizable window. An unconfirmed display
      change reverts automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535397
    m_Localized: 'RESOLUTION: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535398
    m_Localized: Cycles through unique screen sizes. Apply when ready; you have 15
      seconds to keep the new display settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535399
    m_Localized: Display size follows your console.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535400
    m_Localized: APPLY DISPLAY CHANGES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535401
    m_Localized: ' CONTROLLER'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535402
    m_Localized: Press a key. Esc cancels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535403
    m_Localized: 'Choose a keyboard key for '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535404
    m_Localized: . Duplicate and reserved bindings are rejected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535405
    m_Localized: 'INVERT CAMERA Y: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535406
    m_Localized: Reverses vertical camera movement for mouse and right stick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535407
    m_Localized: Camera sensitivity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535408
    m_Localized: Text / HUD size
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535409
    m_Localized: 'REDUCED MOTION: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535410
    m_Localized: Reduces camera movement and removes menu fades and animated scrolling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535411
    m_Localized: 'TENSION SYMBOLS: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535412
    m_Localized: Adds a clear ! warning to high cable loads, alongside the existing
      warning text and colour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535413
    m_Localized: 'TUTORIAL HINTS: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535414
    m_Localized: Show short contextual help while learning. Mission objectives and
      cable warnings always remain visible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535415
    m_Localized: 'CONTROLLER VIBRATION: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535416
    m_Localized: Gentle feedback for cable load, winching, impacts and recovery events.
      Turn it off at any time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535417
    m_Localized: Vibration intensity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535418
    m_Localized: HOW TO PLAY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535419
    m_Localized: Read the driving, recovery and workshop guide. Start or replay training
      from the main menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535420
    m_Localized: RESET PROGRESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535421
    m_Localized: 'Reset all career progress?


      Credits, purchased equipment,
      recoveries, saved setups and your starter choice will be erased. Audio, video
      and control preferences will be kept.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535422
    m_Localized: Erase career progress and choose a new starter. Your audio, video
      and control settings are kept. Leave the session before resetting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535423
    m_Localized: Return to the main menu to reset progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535424
    m_Localized: RESTORE TAB DEFAULTS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535425
    m_Localized: 'Restore the default '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535426
    m_Localized: ' settings? Career progress is kept.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535427
    m_Localized: RESTORE DEFAULTS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535428
    m_Localized: Previous tab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535429
    m_Localized: Next tab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535430
    m_Localized: WELCOME TO TOW TROUBLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535431
    m_Localized: A few comfort settings, then choose your first ride.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535432
    m_Localized: TAKE YOUR TIME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535433
    m_Localized: You can change these settings later. Your first car comes next.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535434
    m_Localized: CHOOSE YOUR FIRST RIDE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535435
    m_Localized: Set the sound to suit your space. Vehicle effects, music, environment
      and interface have separate controls. Muting audio never removes visual feedback.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535436
    m_Localized: Graphics are adjusted automatically for this console.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535437
    m_Localized: Choose your display settings on the left, then Apply. Keep the result
      within 15 seconds or the previous settings return automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535438
    m_Localized: 'Controls follow your connected controller automatically. Switch
      to your keyboard or mouse whenever you prefer.


      Adjust camera sensitivity
      below, or invert its vertical movement.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535439
    m_Localized: 'Select an action to change its keyboard binding. Each key can have
      one action; menu navigation keys stay reserved.


      Connect a controller
      to see its button layout.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535440
    m_Localized: "Choose readable text and comfortable camera movement. On a small
      screen, try 120\u2013130% text size. Cable warnings can include symbols as
      well as colour."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535441
    m_Localized: Contextual hints help you learn at your own pace. Reset Progress
      starts a new career and keeps your preferences.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535442
    m_Localized: ON
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535443
    m_Localized: OFF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
