  - m_Id: 4721729589
    m_Localized: ' to steer. Brake before tight turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729590
    m_Localized: "Right stick \xB7 Look around. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729591
    m_Localized: "Hold RMB \xB7 Look around. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729592
    m_Localized: ' resets the camera.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729593
    m_Localized: ' returns your vehicle to a safe point. Resets affect the recovery
      bonus.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729594
    m_Localized: 'Bring your rear hitch close to the target''s tow point. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729595
    m_Localized: ' attaches or detaches the cable.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729596
    m_Localized: 'Use '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729597
    m_Localized: ' to reel in and '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729598
    m_Localized: ' to pay out. Ease off when the cable is at risk. Firm ground improves
      grip.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729599
    m_Localized: Once the car is free, tow it to the marked drop-off and stop inside.
      If the cable detaches, return and reconnect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729600
    m_Localized: 'Stop near the workshop and detach your cable. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729601
    m_Localized: ' opens the garage. Browsing previews a part; it does not buy it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729602
    m_Localized: Bodies and engines add pull. Tires help apply it to the ground.
      Match cable strength to your pull and winch. Weight helps anchoring but adds
      load uphill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729603
    m_Localized: Buy & Fit purchases the highlighted part. Owned parts refit for
      free. Saved setups store fitted equipment, and previews revert when you leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729604
    m_Localized: REPLAY TRAINING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729605
    m_Localized: Training starts from the main menu. Your current recovery stays
      active.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729606
    m_Localized: YOU'RE READY TO ROLL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729607
    m_Localized: PRACTICE CAR DELIVERED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729608
    m_Localized: 'Training complete. Your career equipment is back in place.


      Choose
      a recovery when you''re ready. You can revisit the guide or training from the
      main menu.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729609
    m_Localized: 'Good work. One last stop: the workshop.


      We''ll park you
      in the yard. Open the garage, preview some equipment, then choose Finish Training.
      Practice purchases do not affect your career.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729610
    m_Localized: START EXPLORING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729611
    m_Localized: VISIT THE WORKSHOP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729612
    m_Localized: "Right stick \xB7 Look around"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729613
    m_Localized: "Hold RMB \xB7 Look around"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729614
    m_Localized: " \xB7 Drive    Left stick \xB7 Steer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729615
    m_Localized: 'Drive a little using '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729616
    m_Localized: ' and '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729617
    m_Localized: " \xB7 Attach your cable"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729618
    m_Localized: ' to reel in, then pull the car free'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729619
    m_Localized: Tow the practice car to the marked bay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729620
    m_Localized: Practice car delivered
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
