    m_Localized: End training? Your career progress is unchanged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729721
    m_Localized: Return to the main menu? This recovery will be abandoned without
      payment. Purchased equipment and earned credits stay saved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729722
    m_Localized: Select letters with the D-pad or left stick. Choose Done to save,
      or Back to cancel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
