    m_Localized: Original equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729750
    m_Localized: "Stock cable \xB7 11 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729751
    m_Localized: Break threshold 11 kN. Build the pull gently and avoid sudden jerks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729752
    m_Localized: "Light cable \xB7 14 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729753
    m_Localized: First cable upgrade. Break threshold 14 kN.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729754
    m_Localized: "Standard cable \xB7 18 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729755
    m_Localized: Break threshold 18 kN. More headroom for load and sudden jerks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729756
    m_Localized: "Stock winch \xB7 8 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4721729757
    m_Localized: 8 kN; up to 1.0 m/s. Slows under load and stalls at its limit.
