  - m_Id: 4730118232
    m_Localized: All-terrain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118233
    m_Localized: "All-terrain \xB7 four-wheel set. Road 0%, mud +10%, sand 0%, snow
      0%. Mass 0 kg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118234
    m_Localized: Mud tires
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118235
    m_Localized: "Mud \xB7 four-wheel set. Road 0%, mud +30%, sand 0%, snow 0%. Mass
      0 kg. Mud resistance -15%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118236
    m_Localized: Wide sand tires
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118237
    m_Localized: "Wide sand \xB7 four-wheel set. Road 0%, mud -10%, sand +45%, snow
      0%. Mass 0 kg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118238
    m_Localized: Studded winter tires
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118239
    m_Localized: "Studded winter \xB7 four-wheel set. Road 0%, mud -15%, sand 0%,
      snow +65%. Mass 0 kg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118240
    m_Localized: Engine level 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118241
    m_Localized: Nominal drive +20%; usable force remains grip-limited.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118242
    m_Localized: Engine level 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118243
    m_Localized: Nominal drive +35%. Full price from stock engine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118244
    m_Localized: Low range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118245
    m_Localized: Drive +25%; top speed -20%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118246
    m_Localized: Off-road suspension
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118247
    m_Localized: Ride height +15 cm; improved support on uneven ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118248
    m_Localized: "Reinforced cable \xB7 26 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118249
    m_Localized: Break threshold 26 kN.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118250
    m_Localized: "Professional cable \xB7 36 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118251
    m_Localized: Break threshold 36 kN.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118252
    m_Localized: "Improved winch \xB7 14 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118253
    m_Localized: 14 kN; up to 1.3 m/s. A weaker cable can break. Grip matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118254
    m_Localized: Body paint finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118255
    m_Localized: Heavy alpine tires
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118256
    m_Localized: "Heavy alpine \xB7 four-wheel set. Road 0%, mud -20%, sand 0%, snow
      +135%. Mass +35 kg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118257
    m_Localized: "Professional winch \xB7 22 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118258
    m_Localized: '22 kN; up to 0.85 m/s. Recommended: 26 kN cable and firm footing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118259
    m_Localized: Workshop meadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118260
    m_Localized: The front-left wheel is caught in a rut. Pull progressively toward
      the trail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118261
    m_Localized: Forest ruts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118262
    m_Localized: The wheels dug two deep muddy ruts. Clear the tree first, then pull
      straight out of the tracks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118263
    m_Localized: Forest depot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118264
    m_Localized: The mud pit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118265
    m_Localized: The car is bellied on a mud ridge, with its wheels sunk in silt.
      Find firm footing for the winch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118266
    m_Localized: Forester ravine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118267
    m_Localized: The left wheels fell into the forest ditch. Move the tree and recover
      along the forward ramp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118268
    m_Localized: Lakeside landing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118269
    m_Localized: Fishing shore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118270
    m_Localized: The car reversed into the lake; its wheels are underwater. Pull
      toward the dry bank ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118271
    m_Localized: Reed bank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118272
    m_Localized: Silt beside the reeds swallowed the rear wheels. Clear the tree
      and pull from firm ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118273
    m_Localized: Shore boulders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118274
    m_Localized: The car slid onto the bank edge, with its left wheels lower. Pull
      up the ramp between the rocks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118275
    m_Localized: Hidden bay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118276
    m_Localized: The car is stranded in the cove with its lower body flooded. Winch
      it from the dry bank.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118277
    m_Localized: Gravel bend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118278
    m_Localized: Engine failure and sticking rear brakes. Free the wheels with a
      smooth pull, then tow the car to the workshop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118279
    m_Localized: Mountain refuge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118280
    m_Localized: Below the mountain road
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118281
    m_Localized: The car slipped below the road and sits tilted on the bank. Set
      up on the road above and pull it back uphill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118282
    m_Localized: Below the road
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118283
    m_Localized: One side slid below the road. Recover along the dirt ramp without
      pulling sideways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118284
    m_Localized: Slipped off the switchback
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118285
    m_Localized: Canyon depot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118286
    m_Localized: First snow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118287
    m_Localized: A snow bank blocks the front axle. The tire tracks show the escape
      direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118288
    m_Localized: High cabin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118289
    m_Localized: Frozen hairpin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118290
    m_Localized: The wheels slid into an icy ditch. Clear the fallen tree and keep
      the cable aligned with the ditch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118291
    m_Localized: Blizzard ditch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118292
    m_Localized: The blizzard packed snow under the chassis and around the wheels.
      Pull steadily along the packed tracks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118293
    m_Localized: Summit plateau
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118294
    m_Localized: Engine failure and a seized transmission; the wheels dragged snow
      up to the chassis. Pull straight from firm ground to unjam it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118295
    m_Localized: Sandy entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118296
    m_Localized: The rear wheels dug two pits in the sand. Pull from compact ground
      without jerking the cable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118297
    m_Localized: Beach parking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118298
    m_Localized: Low bluff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118299
    m_Localized: One side fell into the beach ditch. Clear the fallen trunk and use
      the forward ramp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118300
    m_Localized: Wet sand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118301
    m_Localized: Wet sand piled beneath the axle; the wheels left glossy ruts. Position
      on firmer sand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118302
    m_Localized: Lakeside dune
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118303
    m_Localized: The car is bellied on the dune crest. Pull down the broad forward
      ramp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118304
    m_Localized: Dry wash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118305
    m_Localized: The car slid into a dry wash; its banks rise above the wheels. Use
      the forward escape ramp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118306
    m_Localized: Desert stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118307
    m_Localized: Deep dunes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118308
    m_Localized: The rear axle is buried in sand. Wheelspin marks and piled sand
      reveal the blockage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118309
    m_Localized: Canyon roadside bank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118310
    m_Localized: Sand slope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118311
    m_Localized: Engine failure and jammed brakes; the wheels ploughed into the sand.
      Unjam the car with a controlled pull, then tow it to the workshop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118312
    m_Localized: ALPINE POST
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118313
    m_Localized: DROP-OFF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118314
    m_Localized: MOUNTAIN REFUGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
