  - m_Id: 10548241490410
    m_Localized: Choose a recovery, prepare your vehicle, and bring the car to a
      drop-off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490411
    m_Localized: Drive gently. Pull steadily and avoid sudden cable loads.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490412
    m_Localized: Clear the fallen tree before recovering the car.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490413
    m_Localized: Use firm ground and the winch to free the vehicle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490414
    m_Localized: Tow the freed car to the marked drop-off and stop inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490415
    m_Localized: Preview parts before buying. Owned parts can be fitted for free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490416
    m_Localized: Choose one starter for free. Buy other vehicles later in the workshop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490417
    m_Localized: Audio and control preferences save automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490418
    m_Localized: Adjust the volumes separately. Visual warnings remain visible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490419
    m_Localized: Choose a control to rebind it. Each key can have only one action.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490420
    m_Localized: Connect a controller to see its controls. Keyboard and mouse remain
      available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490421
    m_Localized: Reduce camera and menu motion for comfort.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490422
    m_Localized: Show symbols as well as colours for cable tension.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490423
    m_Localized: Text size and camera sensitivity can be changed at any time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490424
    m_Localized: Restore the defaults for this tab? Career progress is kept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490425
    m_Localized: Reset all progress? Credits, vehicles, equipment and saved setups
      will be erased. Preferences will be kept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490426
    m_Localized: Leave the session before resetting progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490427
    m_Localized: Keep the display settings? They revert after 15 seconds unless confirmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490428
    m_Localized: These parts do not fit the new body. They stay in your inventory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490429
    m_Localized: Sell this part? You must buy it again to use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490430
    m_Localized: Save the fitted equipment. Parts being previewed are not saved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490431
    m_Localized: Replace this saved setup with the fitted equipment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490432
    m_Localized: Practice driving, connecting a cable, winching and delivery. Your
      career stays safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490433
    m_Localized: Training can be skipped and replayed from How to Play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490434
    m_Localized: The host chooses the recovery for the crew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490435
    m_Localized: Share the host's local IP address to play together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490436
    m_Localized: Starting your game. Please wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490437
    m_Localized: The game could not start. Return to the menu and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490438
    m_Localized: Leave this recovery without payment? Purchased equipment and earned
      credits are kept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490439
    m_Localized: Use suitable tires, enough pulling power and a strong cable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490440
    m_Localized: More weight helps anchoring but makes uphill towing harder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490441
    m_Localized: Open the garage while stopped near the workshop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490442
    m_Localized: You can change these settings later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490443
    m_Localized: Your career equipment is restored. Choose a recovery when ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490444
    m_Localized: Winch gently and keep the cable aligned with the exit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490445
    m_Localized: A wheel is caught in a rut. Pull steadily toward the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490446
    m_Localized: The chassis is stuck in mud. Pull from firm ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490447
    m_Localized: The car is partly submerged. Pull toward the dry bank.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490448
    m_Localized: The car slid below the road. Pull uphill along the ramp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490449
    m_Localized: Snow or ice has trapped the wheels. Pull along the tracks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490450
    m_Localized: The wheels are buried in sand. Pull from firm ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490451
    m_Localized: The engine or brakes failed. Free the car gently, then tow it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490452
    m_Localized: The car is trapped in a dry channel. Use the exit ramp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490453
    m_Localized: Recover the car and deliver it to
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490454
    m_Localized: Finished recoveries appear here for replay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490455
    m_Localized: No money will be spent until you choose Buy & Fit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490456
    m_Localized: Own this vehicle before fitting parts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490457
    m_Localized: The career could not be read. Original save preserved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10548241490458
    m_Localized: This key is reserved for menus or the camera.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
